    /// it must NOT be re-repaired into an errored result. Delegates to the shared
    /// <c>agents/chat</c> primitive so the repair pass and the backstop detector
    /// (<c>_incompleteToolCallIds</c>) share the single source of truth for terminal
    /// tool states.
    /// </summary>
    abstract _toolPartHasSettledResult: obj with get, set
