    /// "disappearing" tool call) and <c>convertToModelMessages</c> still gets a
    /// tool-result for it (avoiding <c>AI_MissingToolResultsError</c>).
    /// <br /><br />
    /// Override to customize the repaired shape for client-resolved tools — e.g.
