    abstract formatDetachedMilestone: run: obj * milestone: obj -> string
    /// <summary>
    /// Targeted milestone hook for <c>detached: { onMilestones }</c>. Idempotent per run
    /// + milestone NAME (not sequence — a name surfaces at most once even if
    /// re-emitted), so the warm tail and the backbone reconcile converge. Fired
    /// from both paths.
