    /// Find the tool part carrying <c>executionId</c> in its output. With
    /// <c>pausedOnly</c>, only a still-paused output matches — used to locate the
    /// part an approval outcome should replace. Without it, any settled output
    /// matches — used to distinguish "already resolved elsewhere" from "the
    /// part is gone from the transcript" (e.g. compacted away).
    /// </summary>
    abstract _findExecutionToolCall: obj with get, set
    abstract _applyToolUpdateToMessages: obj with get, set
    abstract hasPendingInteraction: unit -> bool
