    /// <summary>
    /// Cancel a scheduled task.
    /// <br /><br />
    /// Schedules are isolated by owner: a top-level agent's
    /// <c>cancelSchedule(id)</c> only matches its own schedules, and a
    /// sub-agent's <c>cancelSchedule(id)</c> only matches schedules it
    /// created. To clear every schedule under a sub-agent (and its
    /// descendants), call <c>parent.deleteSubAgent(Cls, name)</c> from the
    /// parent — that bulk-cleans root-owned bookkeeping via
    /// _cf_cleanupFacetPrefix.
